      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "> ⚠️ **Interactive exploration has moved to the [Campsites webapp](https://campsites.robogeosociety.xyz).** Browse live availability by night, campground and site — with map, per-site calendar, survival and layout views — there. This dashboard now keeps only the **system-wide live overview** (Cloudflare Analytics Engine, always *now*). The per-night / per-site InfluxDB drill-down was retired on 2026-06-20 (see `Cloudflare-migration-plan.md`). For analytics: **Campsite Demand** and **Campsite Predictions**."
